comments[15]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-27T16:25:47.755Z","harness:codex","Start: build a versioned, SDK-owned multi-step agent transcript contract and upgrade the existing token gate to measure complete tasks, recovery retries, output-envelope conformance, and ratcheted bytes/tokens. This is one connected delivery with pm-f05lsg, pm-srns, pm-k23c4c, and pm-fo8g7j."
  "2026-08-27T17:34:22.018Z","harness:codex","Completion evidence: shipped a public SDK-owned versioned transcript parser plus a four-task, eleven-step corpus covering context bootstrap, closed-domain refusal recovery, unknown-option correction, and lifecycle mutation. The mandatory static gate replays independent accounting-off/accounting-on workspaces, verifies output envelopes, exact shell-free retries, mutation receipts, per-step and completed-task ceilings, corpus identity, and a seeded million-token negative control. Final local verification passed 585 files and 8,062 tests at exact 100/100/100/100; all three linked tests passed with sandboxed PM contexts; the gate reports 3,935 composite tokens. Packed npx, packed bunx, and the 88-command dogfood workflow passed."
  "2026-08-27T17:46:08.995Z","harness:codex","Pre-PR documentation verification: corrected tracker links in docs/OUTPUT_TOKEN_ACCOUNTING.md to the canonical feature and issue directories; all five referenced .toon targets now exist in the repository."
  "2026-08-27T20:37:18.646Z","harness:codex","Review correction scope: exact-head findings are governed by pm-wa39rl and pm-ok2kdn; the gate now requires terminal success, executable unknown-option recovery, refusal-metadata exclusivity, and exact self-reported token estimates."
  "2026-08-27T21:13:31.125Z","harness:codex","Corrective pre-close evidence 2026-08-27: pm test pm-8pnj --run --progress passed all 7 linked commands. Results include transcript/parser tests, canonical 4,349-token replay, release automation contracts, exact 100/100/100/100 coverage over 8,067 tests, packed npx smoke for 13 packages, packed bunx contracts execution, and an 88-command temporary-directory package-first dogfood run. Evidence is appended after reopening and before the next close/release; prior history remains immutable."
  "2026-08-27T21:32:01.739Z","harness:codex","Final canonical closeout 2026-08-27: all five review-followup issues in this round are terminal with evidence-before-close ordering. The seven linked acceptance commands, exact 100/100/100/100 coverage, packed npx/bunx, 88-command dogfood, 4,349-token replay, and five-job Nightly matrix all passed before this corrected close/release."
  "2026-08-28T10:50:49.970Z","harness:codex","Delayed CodeRabbit review identified two valid gaps: the canonical files list attributes the transcript parser to output-contracts instead of its defining task-transcript-contracts module, and refusal replay accepts independent_transport without comparing it to an expected per-step accounting mode. This claimed interval will correct both through the SDK-owned transcript schema, corpus, baseline ratchet, and focused/full assurance."
  "2026-08-28T10:56:23.857Z","harness:codex","TDD red evidence: focused transcript/token/schema suite failed as intended before implementation. Parser rejected corpus version 2 because the live contract still requires version 1; token-gate accounting-mode negative controls are not yet enforced; schema parity still reports PM_TOOL_PARAMETERS_SCHEMA_VERSION 4.10.0. Command: node scripts/run-tests.mjs test -- tests/unit/sdk/output-contracts.spec.ts tests/unit/scripts/release/agent-task-token-gate.spec.ts tests/unit/sdk/action-schema-parity.spec.ts."
  "2026-08-28T11:53:54.748Z","harness:codex","Terminal evidence: transcript contract v2 and ratcheted baseline v3 bind all 14 steps to explicit expected/observed accounting modes; 13 are self_reported and the independently measured unknown-option refusal is independent_transport. The real gate completed 5 tasks with 2 retries at 4,349 estimated tokens. Focused parser/gate tests passed 30/30; release automation/readiness passed 57/57; npx packed smoke passed across 13 packages; package-first dogfood passed 88 commands; packed bunx contract acceptance passed. Exact source coverage is 100/100/100/100 and the full static assurance suite passed. Negative controls proved unsupported or mismatched accounting modes and baseline accounting drift fail closed."
  "2026-08-28T12:18:32.039Z","harness:codex","Review correction TDD scope: add failing negative controls for payload-only accounting transport drift, padded underreported receipts, and wrong terminal values before implementation; then rerun linked exact coverage and static assurance before closure."
  "2026-08-28T12:18:53.887Z","harness:codex","Lifecycle recovery note: the runtime correctly refused the deprecated bare reopen path; the intended recurrence comments were appended during that recovery before pm item reopen. This now-active claimed interval owns every substantive source/test mutation and all new terminal verification before re-close."
  "2026-08-28T12:21:08.977Z","harness:codex","TDD red evidence: the focused 36-test transcript/parser/MCP suite failed in four targeted places before implementation. It accepted payload-only accounting transport drift and an underreported padded receipt, dropped/ignored expected_field_values, and lacked append-only MCP ifAbsent guidance. Command: node scripts/run-tests.mjs test -- tests/unit/scripts/release/agent-task-token-gate.spec.ts tests/unit/sdk/output-contracts.spec.ts tests/unit/mcp/runtime-capabilities.spec.ts."
  "2026-08-28T12:35:58.011Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence before terminal gates: accounting-on and accounting-off application payloads now compare exactly after independently removing the receipt; receipt byte/token claims are remeasured; expected_field_values enforce terminal item.status and bulk outcome values; MCP annotation discovery declares ifAbsent add-only exclusivity. The strengthened gate exposed and now covers pm-hmpu4p, where closeItem bypassed the shared reproducible clock."
  "2026-08-28T12:51:45.992Z","harness:codex","Exact coverage evidence: the first complete run passed every test but correctly failed at 45,179/45,180 branches. Added the missing non-finite expected_field_values negative control and reran the entire linked coverage command; it now passes at exact 100% statements, branches, functions, and lines. The immutable failed receipt remains as TDD evidence beside the terminal passing receipt."
  "2026-08-28T14:23:19.839Z","harness:codex","Terminal evidence after the final review corrections: the repository-wide run passed 585 files and 8,088 tests at exactly 60,000 statements, 45,190 branches, 12,477 functions, and 57,779 lines, all 100%. The terminal full static suite then passed every contract, replay, graph, performance, and record-integrity gate; its earlier graph finding produced semantic verification edges rather than a relaxed budget, and its isolated timing miss passed unchanged on rerun."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-27T17:34:22.496Z","harness:codex","Completed-task token budgets are trustworthy only when corpus identity, task and step identities, independent transport bytes, self-reported accounting, executable recovery, and a seeded regression are all checked together."
